{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《愛·回家之開心速遞》將於8月初迎來大結局，劇中「安Bon戀」金城安（周嘉洛飾）與Bonnie譚育英（林凱恩飾）一直是無數劇迷心目中難忘且意難平的CP。二人自「香港島大學」校園時期萌芽的戀情曾因距離問題和平分手，令觀眾大感心碎。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_16296e0ca7b82387-36\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在大結局前夕，編劇驚喜安排二人相隔逾兩千多集後再次上演高甜的「世紀之吻」，極具衝擊力的多角度吻戲畫面搶先曝光，在網上引爆熱烈討論。據TVB娛樂新聞台獨家報道，這場意外之吻源於一場搶婚戲碼：劇中Bonnie的男友蔥頭（丘梓謙飾）遭吳旺達高層「牙斬斬」軟禁並以此逼婚，正當Bonnie身穿婚紗被迫登上教堂婚禮之際，金城安及時趕到英雄救美，混亂間二人意外嘴對嘴親上，喚醒無數觀眾的青春記憶。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"043f2e59-0f93-4972-9ec6-85ad37a7b732.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/202602dJD5LYqS1784711081.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"043f2e59-0f93-4972-9ec6-85ad37a7b732.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_16296e0ca7b82387-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">談到這場備受矚目的吻戲，周嘉洛笑言九年前的螢幕初吻正是獻給林凱恩，如今在劇集臨近畢業之際再次親吻對方，當年細節依然歷歷在目；林凱恩則感激表示：「好感激，仲有嘉洛哥喺我身邊，嗰種感覺係好戰友，而且大家都有成長。」</p><p id=\"p-rc_16296e0ca7b82387-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8975fb3d-d327-474f-94db-65a7c51e3049.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026saPMiGHQXK1784711085.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8975fb3d-d327-474f-94db-65a7c51e3049.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_16296e0ca7b82387-38\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">面對劇迷期盼「安Bon」破鏡重圓的呼聲，林凱恩大賣關子稱「希望大家都開心，觀眾都開心」，而周嘉洛則分享了對角色感情歸宿的見解：「我個人唔想拆散蔥頭同Bonnie，其實安仔同Bonnie嘅關係幾好，唔一定要長相廝守，或者一齊到老，但係互相守護，我覺得喺戲劇世界度，件事係靚嘅。」</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T04:18:29.956910+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":552,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}